    "## Random module\n",
    "\n",
    "Use `np.random` for reproducible pseudo-random numbers. Key functions:\n",
    "- `np.random.seed` — set seed\n",
    "- `np.random.rand` — uniform [0,1)\n",
    "- `np.random.randn` — standard normal\n",
    "- `np.random.randint` — random integers\n",
    "- `np.random.choice` — sample from 1D array\n",
    "\n",
    "Note: new Generator API (`np.random.default_rng`) is recommended for new code."
   ],
   "id": "f12cc9899fb55335"
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "metadata": {
    "ExecuteTime": {
     "end_time": "2025-09-24T03:05:19.442922Z",
     "start_time": "2025-09-24T03:05:19.419910Z"
    }
   },
   "source": [
    "np.random.seed(0)\n",
    "print('rand:', np.random.rand(3))\n",
    "print('randn:', np.random.randn(3))\n",
    "print('randint 0..9:', np.random.randint(0,10, size=(3,3)))\n",
    "print('choice:', np.random.choice([10,20,30,40], size=5))\n",
    "\n",
    "# Recommended: Generator API\n",
    "rng = np.random.default_rng(42)\n",
    "print('rng random:', rng.random(4))\n",
    "print('rng integers:', rng.integers(0, 10, size=4))\n"
   ],
   "id": "96f8cb31fd0222c0",
   "outputs": [
    {
