    "## Practice problems\n",
    "\n",
    "Try these on your own. Solutions follow.\n",
    "\n",
    "1. Create a 5x5 matrix with values 1..25. Replace the border values with 0.\n",
    "2. Given two 1D arrays `x` and `y`, compute all pairwise squared distances efficiently (no Python loops).\n",
    "3. Without using loops, create a 8x8 checkerboard pattern of 0s and 1s.\n",
    "4. Advanced: Use `np.einsum` to compute the matrix\n",
    " product of two 3D tensors along a certain axis.\n"
   ],
   "id": "6239f95a5349e459"
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "### Solutions (runnable)\n"
   ],
